      <title>GitHub 弃用 MAI-Code-1-Flash 模型</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260910/GitHub-%E5%BC%83%E7%94%A8-MAI-Code-1-Flash-%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/</link>
